<title>USA: Piemonte Foods names Costello COO.</title>
<headline>Piemonte Foods names Costello COO.</headline>
<dateline>GREENVILLE, S.C. 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Piemonte Foods Inc said on Tuesday that it named Patrick Costello chief operating officer.</p>
<p>All of the company's operations at its four manufacturing facilities will report to Costello who most recently was senior vice president of operations at the company.</p>
<p>No one at the company was immediately available to say who Costello was replacing as COO.</p>
<p>Piemonte makes and distributes pizza-related foods as well as icing cakes.</p>
